      "created_at": "2017-04-06T01:39:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>Situation: Termi-Nation Unity, Parse, and Omnitron-U vs. Mad Bomber Blade in Tomb of Anubis. It is Mad Bomber Blade's play phase. All heroes are under 10 HP and Anubis is in play.</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Bomber Blade plays Elemental Redistributor, which is immediately destroyed.&nbsp;<span>Anubis triggers and hits Elemental Redistributor, which would be the second highest HP target if it were still in play, but it's not showing as in play, because it went straight to Bomber Blade's trash.&nbsp;</span><span>I know targets can still be in play while they're destroyed (most notably, Explosive Barrels), but since the Redistributor wasn't being *shown* as in the play area, I was surprised to see Anubis target it. It wouldn't have made a difference in the game, but should Anubis have targeted the Redistributor, or should it have hit one of my heroes instead?</span>\n</div>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:12.865Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
