      "raw": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: -webkit-letterpress;\">Situation: Termi-Nation Unity, Parse, and Omnitron-U vs. Mad Bomber Blade in Tomb of Anubis. It is Mad Bomber Blade&#39;s play phase. All heroes are under 10 HP and Anubis is in play.</span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: -webkit-letterpress;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color: rgb(69, 69, 69); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: -webkit-letterpress;\">Bomber Blade plays Elemental Redistributor, which is immediately destroyed.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Anubis triggers and hits Elemental Redistributor, which would be the second highest HP target if it were still in play, but it&#39;s not showing as in play, because it went straight to Bomber Blade&#39;s trash.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">I know targets can still be in play while they&#39;re destroyed (most notably, Explosive Barrels), but since the Redistributor wasn&#39;t being *shown* as in the play area, I was surprised to see Anubis target it. It wouldn&#39;t have made a difference in the game, but should Anubis have targeted the Redistributor, or should it have hit one of my heroes instead?</span></div>",
